        "content": "<p>xia-chao opened <a href=\"https://github.com/bytecodealliance/wasmtime/pull/15213\">PR #15213</a> from <code>xia-chao:fix/blocking-write-max-io</code> to <code>bytecodealliance:main</code>:</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p><a href=\"https://docs.rs/wasmtime-wasi/latest/wasmtime_wasi/struct.WasiCtxBuilder.html#method.max_io_size\">https://docs.rs/wasmtime-wasi/latest/wasmtime_wasi/struct.WasiCtxBuilder.html#method.max_io_size</a></p>\n<p>blocking_write_and_flush writes the whole buffer at once. split it into max_io_size chunks so blocking writes match this documented limit.<br>\n</p>\n</blockquote>",
